cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use rrcscope in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "rrcscope: live LTE/5G NAS and RRC monitoring for Shannon-modem Pixels"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Malik
    given-names: Ali Hamza
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/alirafiqmalik/rrcscope"
keywords:
  - LTE
  - 5G NR
  - RRC
  - NAS
  - GSMTAP
  - baseband
  - Samsung Shannon
  - handover
  - measurement report
abstract: >-
  Streams NAS and RRC control-plane messages from the Samsung Shannon modem of a
  rooted Google Pixel to Wireshark as GSMTAP, through SCAT, and reports mobility
  events (measurement reports with their trigger and signal levels, and handovers
  identified by mobilityControlInfo / reconfigurationWithSync) from dissected fields.
